cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the author and exact version of this exposition."
title: "What the Hadamard conjecture promises"
type: software
version: "3"
authors:
  - family-names: "Soh"
    given-names: "Wei Meng"
    affiliation: "Whyme Labs"
abstract: >-
  An exposition of the Hadamard conjecture: the multiple-of-four condition,
  flatness and determinant characterizations, equivalent combinatorial forms,
  Sylvester, Paley and Williamson constructions, the computational frontier,
  asymptotic and density results, and an application showing that perfect
  balance does not guarantee lower quantization error. No conjecture solution,
  model performance result or prize committee acceptance is claimed.
keywords:
  - "Hadamard conjecture"
  - "Hadamard matrices"
  - "mathematical exposition"
  - "quantization"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
